(1 Introduction to Photosynthesis) Tj T*
(Photosynthesis is how plants turn light into chemical energy.) Tj T*
(It takes place in the chloroplasts of leaf cells.) Tj T*
(Chlorophyll absorbs mostly red and blue light.) Tj T*
ET
