(2 The Light Reactions) Tj T*
(The light reactions happen in the thylakoid membranes.) Tj T*
(Water is split and oxygen is released as a by-product.) Tj T*
(ATP and NADPH carry energy to the next stage.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
