(3 The Calvin Cycle) Tj T*
(The Calvin cycle takes place in the stroma.) Tj T*
(The enzyme RuBisCO fixes carbon dioxide.) Tj T*
(The cycle produces G3P, which the plant uses to make glucose.) Tj T*
ET
